WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.720
Some things are the same on every visit.

2
00:00:03.480 --> 00:00:07.440
You might have a standard answer you give to a question every time.

3
00:00:07.440 --> 00:00:12.700
For example, "Used cooking oil is stored in sealed containers, away from any heat."

4
00:00:12.700 --> 00:00:17.500
With Quickler, you can set it once as the usual answer for that question.

5
00:00:17.500 --> 00:00:21.840
If you don't mention it on the day, Quickler inserts your usual answer for you.

6
00:00:21.840 --> 00:00:25.940
And if something's different, just say so, and your real words are used instead.
